      "message": "\u003e Maybe it\u0027s easy to implement...\n\nActually it is more complicated: besides pVM pages, the host would also need to set_memory_np() any pages it implicitly donates to the hypervisor, e.g. struct kvm or struct kvm_vcpu when creating a VM or a vCPU, and so on...",
      "parentUuid": "580fea83_3bfb01be",
      "revId": "fc67f64b09e805497d46c1b7b1eebe44f22ef261",
